  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Given, the&nbsp;minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;which is possible, when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
